WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Sample loaded. Original image on the left; model prediction on the right.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Green pixels and boxes mark polyp candidates at threshold 0.40.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Inspect model settings and region measurements. Scores are not disease probabilities.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Run analysis again at 0.40. Four candidate regions appear.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.500
Raise the threshold to 0.85. Rerun.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.500
At 0.85, the mask shrinks to one region. Inspect its measurements.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.600
Lower to 0.20. Run analysis again.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.700
Three candidate regions appear. Research use only.
